I left out both operations requests. This node is declared with only `wasi:clocks`, so it has no filesystem or HTTP capability. Adding either would widen its authority beyond the graph's declared capabilities, and the metadata call would send the input text to an external host. If operations needs logging or enrichment, that should be a separate node with those capabilities declared in the graph.

